   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "widgets_values": [
    "PLAN \u2014 render_width / render_height\n\nLeave them at 0. They change nothing about the plan: not a\nboundary, not a length, not the count. They exist only so the info\ntext can quote a token share, and it needs a render size to work\none out. The crop sets the render size and its width/height go\nstraight to the conditioning node, so a number typed here would\njust be a stale second copy.\n\nchunk_frames is the lever that matters. It is the chunk LENGTH,\nsnapped up to a legal run (17n+5).\n\n`scene` mode splits on hard cuts first and fills each shot; the\nfirst chunk of every shot re-detects the mask rather than seeding\nfrom the previous one, because across a cut the old mask points at\nwhere she stood in a different shot."
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
